🔹 What is GitHub Actions?
GitHub Actions is a built-in CI/CD service in GitHub that allows you to automate workflows like:
Build
Test
Scan
Deploy
 based on repository events.

🔹 Why CI/CD with GitHub Actions?
No separate CI tool required
Native GitHub integration
Faster automation setup
Ideal for cloud & DevOps pipelines

🔹 GitHub Actions vs Jenkins
GitHub Actions uses YAML workflows
Jenkins requires server setup & plugins
Actions is GitHub-native
Jenkins is tool-agnostic

🔥 3-Line Takeaway
Automation starts with commits.
 CI/CD removes manual effort.
 GitHub Actions simplifies DevOps.
